      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "S01.L003",
          "source_line": 3,
          "text": "Strictly business. Count it twice."
        },
        {
          "id": "S01.L004",
          "source_line": 4,
          "text": "Fuel ain’t free, and neither am I."
        },
        {
          "id": "S01.L005",
          "source_line": 5,
          "text": "Pay me up front. You’re buying a ride."
        },
        {
          "id": "S01.L006",
          "source_line": 6,
          "text": "Saving the galaxy costs extra. Nice try."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "source_heading": "[Verse]",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 20,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "S02.L009",
          "source_line": 9,
          "text": "Listen - My Bitch got money to spare. -She felling me "
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L010",
          "source_line": 10,
          "text": "..but you got ta pay me to care, baby…pay me baby,"
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L011",
          "source_line": 11,
          "text": "Baby, I Owe big Nigg Gah’s money honey, part of the smuggle game - naga hunting, ducking - ducking, bounty hunt-ahhhs, Jabbah funding,  "
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L012",
          "source_line": 12,
          "text": "If it’s all the same - then Trust - trust, not safe ta play with my name, my name"
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L014",
          "source_line": 14,
          "text": "Scruffy? - that was a low blow  - If I’m being formal - it’s el capatain Solo - Solo …Han to the Dolo.. Dolo…."
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L015",
          "source_line": 15,
          "text": "And one thing i know though - the empire’s imperial GO GOs can suck a fat - oh no…"
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L017",
          "source_line": 17,
          "text": "Oh no hoe, …..This junky ship - fastest in the galaxy!"
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L018",
          "source_line": 18,
          "text": "This junky ship? Dustin Fleet’s, they can’t catch me! My my my Junky ship, Made Kessel - that set me free!"
        },
        {
          "id": "S02.L019",
          "source_line": 19,
          "text": "Beat the Maw,  less than twelve-par! Twelve-Par!"
        }
      ]
    },
