          "text": "Dinner date with Darth Vader? —"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L084",
          "source_line": 84,
          "text": "I ain’t order this shit."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L086",
          "source_line": 86,
          "text": "I Tried to be her knight In that shinin’ armor."
        },
