          "text": "Now I’m her Carbon Knight."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L089",
          "source_line": 89,
          "text": "I guess I got the title right …. got the title right.. night night…"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L091",
          "source_line": 91,
          "text": "Chewie, keep her safe, "
