          "text": "She can talk all that shit."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L094",
          "source_line": 94,
          "text": "Just make sure she gets home."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L096",
          "source_line": 96,
          "text": "She ain’t ask what I’m worth."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L097",
