          "text": "She ain’t ask what I owe."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L098",
          "source_line": 98,
          "text": "She said, “I love you.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10.L100",
          "source_line": 100,
          "text": "I know…. I know."
